# Project structure

MindDrift is a local-first Chrome MV3 extension. Follow the layered layout in `AGENTS.md`.

## Ownership

| Layer | Path | Put here |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Entry shells | `src/popup`, `src/options`, `src/background`, `src/content` | Mounting / orchestration only |
| UI | `src/components/screens`, `src/components/ui` | Screens and shared React UI |
| Chrome APIs | `src/chrome` | `storage`, `messaging`, `tabs` wrappers |
| Constants | `src/constants` | Keys, thresholds, defaults, message types |
| Pure logic | `src/lib` | Detection, domain helpers — no Chrome calls |
| Types | `src/types` | Shared TypeScript types |
| Hooks | `src/hooks` | Reusable React hooks |

## Imports

```ts
// ❌ BAD
import { storageGet } from '../shared/storage';

// ✅ GOOD
import { storageGet } from '@/chrome/storage';
```

## Do not

- Dump feature logic into `popup/` or `background/service-worker.ts`
- Call raw `chrome.*` from React screens when a `@/chrome` helper exists or should
- Add backend, auth, cloud storage, or dashboard UI in MVP
